	(text "Sensor 1 → PB6: Autonics PNP proximity sensor, PC817 opto input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 22.86 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "0ade48af-e06d-58b2-8d57-e56792c6aa84")
	)
	(text "J10: 1 = +24 V (brown) through F7 100 mA PTC, 2 = sensor output (black), 3 = 0 V (blue).\nOutput ON (24 V): ≈ 2.3 mA through R24 10k + U6 LED → PB6 HIGH (3.3 V, emitter follower).\nOutput OFF, cable unplugged or broken: PB6 LOW (R25 10k pull-down).\nD18 1N4148W: reverse clamp across the opto LED. C14 100 nF / 50 V: supply decoupling + ESD.\nA shorted sensor cable trips F7 only: the other sensor and the board keep running."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 33.02 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "f9e4635c-24ca-5882-b6b7-6aa900b4b9ca")
	)
	(text "Sensor 2 → PC15: Autonics PNP proximity sensor, PC817 opto input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 78.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "d4905c44-5710-543b-99f2-0c42ead40a9e")
	)
	(text "J11: 1 = +24 V (brown) through F8 100 mA PTC, 2 = sensor output (black), 3 = 0 V (blue).\nOutput ON (24 V): ≈ 2.3 mA through R26 10k + U7 LED → PC15 HIGH (3.3 V, emitter follower).\nOutput OFF, cable unplugged or broken: PC15 LOW (R27 10k pull-down).\nD19 1N4148W: reverse clamp across the opto LED. C15 100 nF / 50 V: supply decoupling + ESD.\nA shorted sensor cable trips F8 only: the other sensor and the board keep running."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 88.9 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "4a9b88ff-6abf-5c2d-86dc-7428202303c7")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 15.24 132.08)
		(end 297.18 175.26)
		(stroke (width 0) (type dash))
		(fill (type none))
